# Banking Transaction Data Warehouse

## Project Overview

This project is a mini banking data warehouse designed
to analyze customer transactions, accounts and branches.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- SQLite
- SQL
- Matplotlib

## Project Workflow

Raw Banking Data
        ↓
Python / Pandas
        ↓
Data Cleaning
        ↓
SQLite Data Warehouse
        ↓
SQL Analysis
        ↓
Data Visualization

## Data Warehouse Tables

### Dimension Tables
- dim_customer
- dim_account
- dim_branch

### Fact Table
- fact_transaction

## Analysis Performed

- Total transaction amount
- Total deposits
- Total withdrawals
- Transaction type analysis
- Customer-wise analysis
- Branch-wise analysis
- Monthly transaction analysis
- Account type analysis

## ETL Process

Python and Pandas are used to extract transaction
data, transform the data and load the cleaned data
back into the warehouse.

## Outcome

The project demonstrates how banking transaction data
can be stored, transformed and analyzed using a simple
data warehouse architecture.